#IMPORTANT
-If your are running the ui script make sure to run the setup.bat file first

-run_app.bat for testing (if you don't want to make another exe to test)

-When you want to update the exe file run the build_exe.bat file again

-Please run following in vscode terminal BEFORE your next git add/commit/push
    git rm --cached -r build/ dist/ SigmaMusic.spec
